TITLE Pure water pH 7, add sulfuric acid in steps
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
REACTION 1
    H2SO4 1
    0.001 0.005 0.01 0.05 0.1
USER_PUNCH
    -headings viscosity
    10 PUNCH VISCOS
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -reaction true
    -user_punch true
END
